This repository (the appendices of the final report; the finite element model with its scripts, input decks, mesh,
CAD files, results, figures, report and the raw solver output attached to its release; the OpenSim musculoskeletal
model and the MATLAB / Simulink pneumatic model with their scripts, inputs, results and figures) is published so that
the examining committee and other readers can view it and re-run the simulations for review. It belongs to the SDP II final
report "Analytical and Simulation-Based Feasibility Study of a Soft Pneumatic Knee Assist Concept for Post-ACL
Reconstruction Gait" (Yanbu Industrial College, 2026).

No other use is permitted without the prior written permission of the copyright holders. This includes copying,
modifying, redistributing, publishing, or using any part in other work. Short quotations with a full citation of the
report are allowed.

Material from other sources (for example the gait data digitised from Buettner et al., J. Orthop. Res. 43(2):322-336,
2025, doi:10.1002/jor.26001, standards and data sheets) is cited where it is used and remains under the terms of its owners.

THE CONTENT IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND. It is a student feasibility study based on calculation
and simulation only, not a validated medical device, and must not be used for clinical decisions.
